WEBVTT

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.220
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.300
Young Master Shen.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.020
Mengmeng is being held in the Ministry of Justice jail.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.500
I'm afraid they'll use unlawful torture on her.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.300
I'm begging you.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:43.936
Please help me.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.256
Let me go see her.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.776
His Majesty has already ordered

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.300
That no one may visit her.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.580
Mengmeng, you poor thing.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.216
You clearly rendered great service,

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.816
Yet you're still locked in prison,

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.056
Without enough to eat,

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.016
Without warm clothes,

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.820
And subjected to torture.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.300
No one is even helping you.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.100
-Enough. -What are we going to do?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:10.900
Enough.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.056
Stop crying.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.300
I'll arrange it.

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.060
Really?

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.056
Thank you, Young Master Shen.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.696
Don't go falling in love with me now

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.340
And offering yourself in marriage.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.416
You're overthinking it.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:27.576
You don't meet my standards.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.176
I am the capital's most charming and talented gentleman,

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.656
Yet you actually look down on me?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.136
Still, thank you.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.176
Don't.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.176
Don't thank me.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.696
I'm only doing this for Zhili's sake.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:38.860
I'm here!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.056
Everything is packed.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.340
Let's go.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.656
These are all things my lady will need.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.656
The jail is damp. I'm afraid she won't be used to it.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.896
Right. I left in such a hurry

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.060
That I forgot to prepare any of this.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.696
I didn't expect someone else to care about Mengmeng as much as I do.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.860
Thank you.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.936
All right.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.220
Don't waste any more time.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.096
Go visit Official Meng at once.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.620
I'll enter the palace and see His Majesty.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:08.860
-Let's go. -All right.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.136
Impressive skills, Your Majesty.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.580
Your turn.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:22.936
Your Majesty,

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.536
In your present state of mind,

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.140
You are not fit to spar with me.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.540
Your Majesty...

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.496
Your Majesty,

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:40.256
You cannot take your anger over Meng Tinghui

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:41.420
Out on us.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.540
My lady, this weapon will help us escape.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.776
And this drug will incapacitate the guards.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.980
I'll get you out of this jail.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.176
Great minds think alike.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.416
I had the same idea.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.136
Mengmeng, we don't have to endure this humiliation.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.216
Forget this official post.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.216
My Bofeng House in the capital

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:04.256
Hasn't been under renovation for long,

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.176
So I haven't invested too much yet.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.016
We'll sublet the shop and return to Shazhou.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.940
Then we can live comfortably.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.136
My brother arranged for us to visit.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.056
Is it really appropriate to discuss a jailbreak

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.340
Right in front of me?

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.976
Given Young Master Shen's friendship with His Majesty,

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.376
He naturally won't be implicated.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.336
Nonsense.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.536
If I flee like this,

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.620
I'll become guilty even if I was innocent.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.936
Put away all these drugs

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.380
And weapons at once.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.816
His Majesty has gone too far.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.776
You worked so hard to place first in all three exams and become Director of the Bureau,

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.176
Yet he dismissed you just like that?

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.816
And locked you in this wretched cell.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.216
So much for an emperor's sacred word

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.456
Being as weighty as nine tripods.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.656
It all depends on his mood.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.296
Had I been there,

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.936
I would have given him a thorough scolding.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.776
I would have torn him to shreds with my words.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.460
Good heavens.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.100
Thank goodness you weren't there.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.176
Otherwise, the ones in this cell now

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.456
Would be the two of you.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.856
We came today

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.376
To persuade Official Meng to apologize to His Majesty.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.736
Apologize?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.220
Absolutely not.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:03.020
I see she has not reflected on her actions at all.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.656
I expected her to act rashly

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.020
And use cruel methods,

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.976
But I never imagined

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.096
She would act entirely on her own

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.576
Without even informing me.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.696
Exactly.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.936
His Majesty merely dismissed her.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.256
That was already lenient.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.416
In my view, at least thirty strokes

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.900
Would make the lesson stay with her.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:20.576
Brother!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.296
Sister sent you to make peace, not to fan the flames.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.136
Official Meng merely acted on impulse.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.460
She did not intend to offend you.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.376
She did not intend it?

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.060
Then did I deliberately make things difficult for her?

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.660
The entire court opposed my decision,

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:35.176
Yet I defied them all and appointed her.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.460
And this is how little she values it.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.936
I entered government to eradicate evil

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.260
And protect the people.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.696
Those who wield authority,

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.176
If they care only about their careers,

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.976
Will surely stand upon a mountain of bones.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.500
With the people's lives at stake,

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:51.936
How could I stand by and let them die?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.496
In the capital,

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.816
I repeatedly witnessed the Tiger Roar Gang colluding with officials.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.136
If I did not execute them without mercy,

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.376
How could I deter those in power?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.576
If Your Majesty

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.776
Wanted only an obedient official,

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.056
Why appoint me Director of the Bureau?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.540
Exactly.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.020
Mengmeng is right.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.616
I have always taken the law as my standard,

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.100
But this time, I also support Official Meng.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.696
I hope she can return to lead the Bureau.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.660
Besides, from what I know of His Majesty,

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.980
He does not truly intend to dismiss her.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.700
My lady,

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.980
Has His Majesty issued a decree?

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.260
Not yet.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.096
Back in the palace,

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.816
She alternated between defiance and vulnerability,

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.140
Confided in me,

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.616
And tried every trick to obtain a post at the Bureau.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.220
I gave her a chance and personally appointed her.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.376
Yet she has no sense of proper limits.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.536
Exactly.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.336
She has grown arrogant because of Your Majesty's favor.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.856
Your Majesty entrusted her with an important post,

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.176
Yet she dared defy you.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.456
She acts recklessly and refuses to be controlled.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.296
She is wholly unfit to serve at court.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.376
Your Majesty should send her back to Shazhou

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.496
And never employ her again.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.420
She is unfit, but you are?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:03.736
As an Imperial Survey Envoy,

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.460
I am naturally far more capable.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.096
I appointed Meng Tinghui Director of the Bureau

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.736
Only after careful consideration.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.016
I know better than anyone whether she is suited to the post.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.340
Then why did Your Majesty imprison her?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.380
I understand now.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.576
On the surface, Your Majesty is punishing Meng Tinghui,

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.340
But in truth, you are appeasing the Left Chancellor and the other officials.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.696
Your Majesty has gone to great lengths

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.900
To protect Meng Tinghui.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.820
When did I say I wanted to protect her?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.576
Since no decree has been issued,

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.936
Official Meng remains Director of the Bureau.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.540
There is still room to turn things around.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.300
Aside from calming public outrage,

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.660
What other purpose

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.100
Does Your Majesty have in doing all this?

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:12.980
Xuanhuang?

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:15.820
Where did you go?

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.780
My precious,

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.980
Where have you flown off to?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.820
I haven't seen you all day.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.420
Master!

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.380
Master!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.576
Have you seen Xuanhuang?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.740
I have not.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.096
But there is a visitor outside

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.656
Who specially delivered some fine pastries.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:39.180
He said you would understand once you saw them.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.656
Can't you see I'm busy?

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.696
Put them down

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.616
-and leave. -But...

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:44.896
Go.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.660
Then I'll look by the gate.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.376
Hurry and find it.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.060
Honestly...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.140
Xuanhuang!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.060
My precious!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.220
Where have you flown off to?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.460
Xuanhuang!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.300
My precious!

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.740
Who did this?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.416
My poor precious darling!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.580
My heart...

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.620
The Left Chancellor wants to see you. Move.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.016
The Left Chancellor is occupied with affairs of state.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.696
Why would he wish to see a prisoner like me?

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.736
Why so many questions?

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.296
The Left Chancellor has his reasons

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.820
For summoning you.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.496
If you dare use unlawful torture,

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.100
His Majesty has eyes and ears everywhere.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.256
He will learn of it.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.420
His Majesty?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.656
Do you truly think the present emperor

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.456
Has time to care about a prisoner like you?

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.940
Move.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.776
Don't touch me.

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:23.856
I can walk on my own.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.060
Don't try anything clever,

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.256
Or you'll suffer for it.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.420
Move.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.980
I love the scent of those about to die,

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.740
Especially a beauty.

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.656
Who are you?

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.220
Meng Tinghui.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:32.896
I remember every word

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.220
Of the message you sent me.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.900
Leader of the Tiger Roar Gang,

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.336
My only regret is that I did not cut Lü Er into pieces that day

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.496
And grind his bones to ash.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.300
But it doesn't matter.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:47.340
You're next.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:50.700
I'd like to see how a dead woman takes revenge.

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.900
Lü Da, do it.

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.016
Chief.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.180
Lü Da!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:09.816
-It's a trap! Retreat! -All right!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.260
After them!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.056
Official Meng, you must have been frightened.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.176
By His Majesty's command,

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.860
I was assigned to protect you in secret.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.056
By His Majesty's oral decree,

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.340
Minister of Justice Wan Kai is to be brought in for questioning.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.856
By His Majesty's oral decree...

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.460
Minister of Justice Wan Kai is to be brought in for questioning.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.260
Minister Wan!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:47.980
Minister Wan!

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:51.980
Who did this to you?

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.060
Minister Wan!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.060
Minister Wan!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.256
Chief!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.580
Chief, wait!

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.060
No... no.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:24.536
I can't go on.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:26.016
You must leave.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.740
Stop talking. We're leaving together.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.456
They headed toward Changle Street.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:38.620
After them!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.816
Your Majesty,

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.976
The leader of the Tiger Roar Gang has vanished.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.536
The shadow guards followed him to Changle Street,

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.416
But found only a trail of blood and no sign of him.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.060
He disappeared remarkably quickly.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.300
Changle Street?

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.016
Did Wan Kai reveal anything?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.896
When I reached Minister Wan's residence,

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.616
He had already been stabbed

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.860
And was barely alive.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.860
Before he died, he left this behind.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.696
If Wan Kai was nothing more

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.816
Than a disposable pawn to the Tiger Roar Gang,

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:18.896
Then the gang's collusion with court officials

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.540
Is far from ordinary.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.536
Your Majesty came personally to the Ministry jail to receive a commoner like me.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.740
I am overwhelmed by the honor.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.216
You have suffered.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.780
Never forget your original purpose.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.296
How could I call that suffering?

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.016
Do you blame me?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.096
I would not dare.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.260
The next time Your Majesty has such a plan,

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.456
Please inform me beforehand.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.740
I fear my performance may not be convincing enough.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.976
You no longer need to call yourself a commoner.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:06.896
In apprehending the Tiger Roar Gang,

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.256
You acted recklessly,

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.256
But your merits offset your faults.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.660
By special decree,

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.300
You are restored to your former post.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.700
You remain Director of the Bureau.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.420
I thank Your Majesty for your great grace.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.060
The leader of the Tiger Roar Gang was indeed colluding with Wan Kai.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.856
But after he fled to Changle Street,

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.976
He vanished without a trace.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.220
As for Wan Kai,

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.856
The moment I ordered him brought in for questioning,

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.496
He died suddenly at his residence,

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.656
Leaving only a note.

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.300
Your Majesty,

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.100
I knew full well

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:49.300
That you were using me as bait.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.376
I hereby promise Your Majesty

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.900
That as long as I serve at the Bureau,

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.416
I will pursue the Tiger Roar Gang

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.176
To the very end.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.340
But today,

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.300
I am tired.

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.980
Please allow me to return and rest.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.896
The wound on your neck...

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.016
I will have an imperial physician

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.136
Treat it properly

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.580
So it does not leave a scar.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.260
I will take you back to the palace first

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:14.940
And then escort you home.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.620
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.660
There is no need to trouble an imperial physician.

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.536
Should it leave a scar,

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.780
It can serve as a constant reminder

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.300
To reflect upon myself

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.860
And never forget my original purpose.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:30.780
Huang Bo.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.096
Escort Official Meng home personally.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:34.616
You must ensure her safety.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.776
Yes.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.180
Please allow me to return alone, Your Majesty.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:42.220
I take my leave.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.180
-Will she hate me forever? -Your Majesty.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.296
Official Meng has a strong and unyielding nature.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.700
She merely does not understand for now.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.780
In time, she will surely understand your painstaking intentions.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.736
Painstaking intentions?

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:05.180
She probably sees me as cold and heartless.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:21.936
Official Meng!

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.256
Official Meng!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.576
Official Meng is here!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.656
Official Meng has returned!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.740
Official Meng! Official Meng is back!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.900
Official Meng! Official Meng is back!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.380
Official Meng!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.860
-Official Meng! -Official Meng!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.296
Official Meng!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.016
We have waited for three days.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.776
You have finally returned.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.940
This is wonderful.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.380
-This is truly wonderful. -It truly is.

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.020
Official Meng,

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.540
Your injury...

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.660
Yes.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:55.300
I accidentally cut myself.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.336
What matters is that all of you are safe.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.776
Over the past few days,

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.616
Has the Tiger Roar Gang caused you any more trouble?

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.300
-No. -No.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.180
It is all thanks to Official Meng.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.096
The land seized by the Tiger Roar Gang

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.940
Has now been taken over by the authorities.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.096
Everyone in the neighborhood

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:13.100
Has also reburied their relatives' remains.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.016
Thank you, Official Meng,

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:16.336
For obtaining justice for us.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.136
-That's right. -Yes.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.336
Had it not been for us,

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.260
You would never have suffered such injustice.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:24.576
-Thank you, Official Meng. -Thank you, Official Meng.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.616
-Thank you, Official Meng. -Thank you, Official Meng.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.056
-Thank you, Official Meng. -Thank you, Official Meng.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.976
Get up, A-Cheng.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.140
Please get up.

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:35.940
Rise. All of you, get up.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.620
Please get up.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.616
You do not need to do this.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.140
This is simply my duty.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:44.296
All that matters is that you are safe.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:45.376
Official Meng,

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.976
This is a small token of our gratitude.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.376
Please accept it.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:49.536
You must accept it.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.936
Please take these back.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:51.976
I only did what I should.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.656
-Take them all back. -My lady, those tyrants

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.976
Drove my entire family from our home,

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.496
Leaving us displaced and homeless.

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:01.176
Without your intervention,

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.216
How could we ever have returned home?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.660
-That's right. -Exactly.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.580
I personally picked these fruits on the mountain.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.256
Please accept them, my lady.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:14.780
Official Meng.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.016
Official Meng.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.376
I heard you are from Shazhou.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.096
I made these Shazhou dishes myself.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.256
You are too thin.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.780
You need to eat more.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.420
That's right, Official Meng.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.856
-Official Meng. -Please rise.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.816
My daughter has been missing for over half a month.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.936
The authorities said they had too many cases and no time to investigate.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:33.896
You must help me.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.176
Official Meng!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.500
Official Meng!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.140
I too have suffered a terrible injustice.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.100
Please uphold justice for me, Official Meng.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.736
Do not worry.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.940
For every grievance you have suffered,

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.936
The Bureau will obtain justice.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.416
But these gifts,

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.780
I truly cannot accept them.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:55.056
You worked hard to save these things,

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.060
And they are barely enough to sustain your families.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:19:59.896
But I understand

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.220
The sincerity behind every gift.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.020
Thank you.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:04.976
Official Meng,

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.496
We are the ones who should thank you.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:08.176
Everyone now knows

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.536
That you and the Bureau

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.260
Truly work for the people.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:13.780
You are the one we can rely on.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:17.496
From now on, you will not only protect us;

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.776
All of us will protect you as well.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.896
Please, you must accept these gifts.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.620
Official Meng, please accept them.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.100
I truly cannot.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:27.660
Thank you.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.896
I really cannot accept them.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:30.936
Please take them back.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.660
Please accept them.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.780
I have repeatedly ordered the capture of the Tiger Roar Gang,

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.860
Yet to this day, there has been no word of them.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.256
Are they truly so capable,

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:14.100
Or is someone obstructing the investigation from the shadows?

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:18.100
I understand Your Majesty's concern.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.016
Now that Wan Kai has died suddenly,

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.416
The Ministry of Justice has no one to lead it.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.176
I recommend the Vice Minister of War

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.456
To temporarily oversee the Ministry of Justice

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.256
And thoroughly investigate the Tiger Roar Gang.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:29.056
The Tiger Roar Gang case

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.700
Has already been entrusted entirely to the Bureau.

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:33.980
As for the next Minister of Justice,

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.696
I will make my own decision.

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:37.180
Your Majesty,

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:39.536
I would like to know

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.576
Whom you intend to appoint.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.660
Left Chancellor, perhaps you should first explain

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:45.696
Why Wan Kai, acting under your orders,

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.256
Secretly removed Meng Tinghui from prison,

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.896
-and why he died suddenly at his residence. -Your Majesty.

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:52.216
I stake my life on this:

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.656
I knew nothing

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.216
Of Wan Kai's actions,

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.056
Nor did I ever order them.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.656
Meng Tinghui and I

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.096
May disagree politically,

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.416
But I never intended to harm her.

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:04.056
Please judge clearly, Your Majesty.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.536
The Left Chancellor makes it sound so simple.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:08.216
Wan Kai nearly tore a hole in the heavens,

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:09.736
Yet you knew absolutely nothing?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.936
It is like your vicious dog biting someone outside.

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:13.616
Can its master truly claim complete innocence?

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:15.016
Insolence!

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:17.256
I am discussing state affairs with His Majesty.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:19.456
How dare you interrupt with such frivolous remarks?

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:21.416
I was merely speaking the truth.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:22.536
If you are truly innocent,

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:24.496
Why fear a few jokes from me?

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:25.616
Shen Zhishu.

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.860
Do not be disrespectful to the Left Chancellor.

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:32.296
However,

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:34.176
The Ministry of War sold military weapons illegally,

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.256
The Ministry of Rites rigged the examinations,

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:38.336
And even the Minister of Justice colluded with a gang

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.816
To prey upon the people.

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:42.380
Left Chancellor, you have led the Six Ministries for many years.

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:44.660
Simply saying you knew nothing

00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:47.260
Will hardly absolve you of responsibility.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:56.340
I have failed in my duty.

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:00.740
I...

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.576
Am willing to resign my post

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:05.180
And retire to my hometown.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:10.536
Your Majesty,

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:12.616
The late emperor entrusted the Left Chancellor

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.056
With assisting you for more than ten years.

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.336
He has served tirelessly through every season.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.496
Though now over seventy,

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.736
He rises before dawn each day to review memorials

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:21.860
And attends court at daybreak.

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:24.576
Your Majesty, please remember his years of loyal service

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:25.900
And punish him leniently.

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:27.736
Your Majesty,

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:29.616
The law must still allow for human sentiment.

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:31.096
If the Left Chancellor is severely punished,

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:33.376
It may chill the hearts of the veteran ministers.

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:35.896
What a fine retreat made in order to advance.

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.456
The Left Chancellor is forcing His Majesty

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:40.100
To choose between law and sentiment.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:00.376
The Left Chancellor

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:03.976
Is a meritorious veteran of three reigns,

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:05.460
A pillar of Great Ning.

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:07.460
His contributions are immense.

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:10.456
How could I truly punish him severely?

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:13.340
However, the Left Chancellor is advanced in years.

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:16.340
From now on, the memorials of the Six Ministries and all affairs of the realm

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.900
Will naturally be handled by me personally.

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:21.900
There will be no need for the Left Chancellor

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:24.380
To continue bearing this burden on my behalf.

00:24:26.960 --> 00:24:28.700
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:45.820
Good!

00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:48.976
Bofeng House opens today under auspicious fortune.

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:50.936
Honored guests, please come inside.

00:24:50.960 --> 00:24:52.980
-Please come in. -This way, please.

00:24:53.640 --> 00:24:55.656
Come, honored guests. Please enter.

00:24:55.680 --> 00:24:56.820
Mind the step.

00:24:59.960 --> 00:25:01.616
What kind of wretched restaurant is this?

00:25:01.640 --> 00:25:02.976
How did it steal half my business

00:25:03.000 --> 00:25:04.456
On its very first day?

00:25:04.480 --> 00:25:05.940
Shopkeeper...

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:08.656
Shopkeeper, I found out.

00:25:08.680 --> 00:25:09.656
The owner of Bofeng House

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:13.176
Is Yan Fuzhi, sworn sister of Official Meng from the Bureau.

00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:14.496
The two of them

00:25:14.520 --> 00:25:16.140
Previously stayed at our inn.

00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:18.816
So it is those two.

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:20.856
This reeks of collusion between officials and merchants.

00:25:20.880 --> 00:25:22.300
They must be exploiting their connections.

00:25:23.360 --> 00:25:24.456
Shunzi.

00:25:24.480 --> 00:25:26.536
Keep a close eye on them.

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:29.260
I will catch them doing something wrong sooner or later.

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:40.576
Shopkeeper Yan, no need to see us farther.

00:25:40.600 --> 00:25:41.496
Gentlemen,

00:25:41.520 --> 00:25:43.976
These are Shazhou preserves exclusive to Bofeng House.

00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:45.976
They are especially refreshing with apricot-peel tea.

00:25:46.000 --> 00:25:47.460
Please accept them.

00:25:49.680 --> 00:25:50.896
Shopkeeper Yan is truly thoughtful.

00:25:50.920 --> 00:25:52.656
We will come to Bofeng House every day

00:25:52.680 --> 00:25:54.216
Until we have tried every Shazhou delicacy.

00:25:54.240 --> 00:25:56.180
Nothing would please me more.

00:25:56.600 --> 00:25:58.860
-Farewell. -Take care.

00:26:00.960 --> 00:26:03.096
Shopkeeper Yan, wipe the drool from your mouth.

00:26:03.120 --> 00:26:04.296
They are already long gone.

00:26:04.320 --> 00:26:05.616
Young Master Shen.

00:26:05.640 --> 00:26:07.740
Which young lady have you invited today?

00:26:10.720 --> 00:26:12.340
Your Maj...

00:26:15.320 --> 00:26:16.376
Shopkeeper Yan.

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:17.656
Wake up.

00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:19.256
Isn't this a little exaggerated?

00:26:19.280 --> 00:26:21.500
If you do not wake up, I may have to breathe air into your mouth.

00:26:24.240 --> 00:26:25.380
In your dreams.

00:26:28.560 --> 00:26:30.096
I heard Bofeng House was opening today,

00:26:30.120 --> 00:26:31.540
So I brought my cousin to support you.

00:26:32.240 --> 00:26:33.376
There is no need for ceremony, Shopkeeper Yan.

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:35.660
Just call me He Du. Where is she?

00:26:36.560 --> 00:26:38.900
Mengmeng is upstairs. This way, Young Master He.

00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:40.776
Mind the step.

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:41.696
Shopkeeper Yan,

00:26:41.720 --> 00:26:44.140
We are all customers. Why treat us so differently?

00:26:45.600 --> 00:26:47.136
Shopkeeper Yan's design

00:26:47.160 --> 00:26:48.376
Seems to have brought the spirit of the desert

00:26:48.400 --> 00:26:49.416
All the way to the capital.

00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:50.816
Every corner is a scene,

00:26:50.840 --> 00:26:51.936
And every room reveals another world.

00:26:51.960 --> 00:26:53.336
Interesting. Very interesting.

00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:54.616
Here on Changle Street,

00:26:54.640 --> 00:26:55.536
Without something distinctive,

00:26:55.560 --> 00:26:57.220
How could I retain honored guests?

00:26:58.440 --> 00:27:00.496
Aside from the Pavilion of Forgetting Sorrows, which I reserved especially for Mengmeng,

00:27:00.520 --> 00:27:01.416
All the other private rooms

00:27:01.440 --> 00:27:02.576
Are reserved for guests who spend

00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:03.856
At least one hundred taels per visit.

00:27:03.880 --> 00:27:05.616
Given Young Master Shen's means,

00:27:05.640 --> 00:27:07.940
I am sure you will soon have a room of your own.

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:15.060
Mengmeng.

00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:25.216
Your Majesty.

00:27:25.240 --> 00:27:26.380
Your Majesty.

00:27:26.800 --> 00:27:28.096
That pretty-faced fellow...

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:30.416
You truly take him everywhere you go.

00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:31.856
Your Majesty,

00:27:31.880 --> 00:27:34.180
Yin Qing is my colleague at the Bureau,

00:27:34.480 --> 00:27:35.860
Not some pretty-faced fellow.

00:27:36.400 --> 00:27:37.376
I am currently investigating a case,

00:27:37.400 --> 00:27:40.180
So naturally Yin Qing must remain at my side.

00:27:41.120 --> 00:27:42.096
My lady,

00:27:42.120 --> 00:27:43.776
His Majesty called me pretty-faced.

00:27:43.800 --> 00:27:45.140
He was praising me.

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:48.340
Investigating a case?

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:51.580
Here?

00:27:51.920 --> 00:27:53.216
The leader of the Tiger Roar Gang

00:27:53.240 --> 00:27:55.140
Was last seen on Changle Street.

00:27:55.320 --> 00:27:57.336
If I conduct an open search,

00:27:57.360 --> 00:27:58.616
I may alert the enemy.

00:27:58.640 --> 00:28:01.860
Bofeng House is located on Changle Street and is well suited for surveillance.

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:04.176
I have made this private room

00:28:04.200 --> 00:28:06.300
An important base for gathering information.

00:28:06.800 --> 00:28:08.180
Your Majesty.

00:28:12.520 --> 00:28:13.776
A-Nian.

00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:14.696
You were in such a hurry today.

00:28:14.720 --> 00:28:16.056
So you came to run errands

00:28:16.080 --> 00:28:17.576
For our Zhili.

00:28:17.600 --> 00:28:19.016
How is that merely running errands?

00:28:19.040 --> 00:28:21.540
A-Nian is assisting me with official business.

00:28:25.400 --> 00:28:26.696
Your Majesty,

00:28:26.720 --> 00:28:28.176
Official Meng was previously worried

00:28:28.200 --> 00:28:29.976
About the investigation into the Tiger Roar Gang.

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.576
This portrait was drawn from her description.

00:28:32.600 --> 00:28:34.496
Although the only clue is a pair of eyes,

00:28:34.520 --> 00:28:36.696
We will follow Official Meng's plan

00:28:36.720 --> 00:28:38.576
And conduct a thorough search of Changle Street.

00:28:38.600 --> 00:28:40.496
I have been familiar with noble and official families since childhood,

00:28:40.520 --> 00:28:42.336
So I am responsible for

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:44.456
All the exclusive teahouses and apothecaries on Changle Street.

00:28:44.480 --> 00:28:46.376
Yin Qing is skilled at dealing with women,

00:28:46.400 --> 00:28:47.736
So he is responsible for

00:28:47.760 --> 00:28:49.736
All the cosmetic shops,

00:28:49.760 --> 00:28:51.336
Music houses, and brothels.

00:28:51.360 --> 00:28:53.216
As for Official Meng,

00:28:53.240 --> 00:28:54.616
She told me

00:28:54.640 --> 00:28:56.816
That she has dealt with people from every walk of life since childhood.

00:28:56.840 --> 00:28:59.816
So she is responsible for all the gambling houses on this street,

00:28:59.840 --> 00:29:01.860
As well as the money shops.

00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:03.340
Your Majesty,

00:29:04.120 --> 00:29:06.020
Must the Bureau also report these arrangements to you

00:29:06.320 --> 00:29:08.336
And await

00:29:08.360 --> 00:29:09.500
Your imperial approval?

00:29:10.880 --> 00:29:12.016
That will not be necessary.

00:29:12.040 --> 00:29:13.656
Then why has Your Majesty suddenly come here?

00:29:13.680 --> 00:29:14.820
What instructions do you have?

00:29:17.800 --> 00:29:19.456
Regarding Wan Kai's death,

00:29:19.480 --> 00:29:21.176
Xu Ting appeared open and composed.

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:23.260
His indignant words did not seem feigned.

00:29:24.600 --> 00:29:26.096
The note Wan Kai left behind

00:29:26.120 --> 00:29:27.700
Still points to no clear culprit.

00:29:28.440 --> 00:29:30.016
Therefore, from now on,

00:29:30.040 --> 00:29:31.860
Besides investigating the Tiger Roar Gang,

00:29:32.400 --> 00:29:34.180
You must uncover the person behind them.

00:29:39.560 --> 00:29:41.416
I will spare no effort

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:42.860
And investigate the matter to the end.

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:50.136
This is a secret medicine specially prepared by the imperial physician.

00:29:50.160 --> 00:29:51.576
It is remarkably effective at removing scars.

00:29:51.600 --> 00:29:53.420
His Majesty obtained it especially for Official Meng.

00:29:56.640 --> 00:29:58.540
I thank Your Majesty for your generous favor.

00:29:59.520 --> 00:30:02.020
However, I have already used Yin Qing's scar-removal ointment,

00:30:02.760 --> 00:30:03.980
And the wound has improved.

00:30:04.800 --> 00:30:06.696
Your Majesty, Official Meng is already healed.

00:30:06.720 --> 00:30:08.376
-There is no need for it. -Your Majesty.

00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:09.896
What Official Meng means is

00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:11.376
That if two medicines

00:30:11.400 --> 00:30:13.136
Are used together,

00:30:13.160 --> 00:30:14.656
They may conflict.

00:30:14.680 --> 00:30:16.020
Are you saying...

00:30:16.640 --> 00:30:18.460
Your medicine is more effective than mine?

00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:24.980
No...

00:30:26.360 --> 00:30:28.100
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

00:30:29.440 --> 00:30:30.536
Let us set official business aside.

00:30:30.560 --> 00:30:31.936
Young Master He actually came today

00:30:31.960 --> 00:30:34.180
To taste an authentic bowl of lamb noodles.

00:30:37.080 --> 00:30:38.056
Mengmeng,

00:30:38.080 --> 00:30:40.976
So you spent the last few days learning to make lamb noodles

00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:42.376
For Young Master He.

00:30:42.400 --> 00:30:43.496
Young Master He,

00:30:43.520 --> 00:30:45.856
Your authentic lamb noodles will be ready shortly.

00:30:45.880 --> 00:30:46.976
I...

00:30:47.000 --> 00:30:48.300
-I did no such thing. -Come with me.

00:30:50.480 --> 00:30:52.576
I arranged to study painting with my teacher

00:30:52.600 --> 00:30:55.136
And also have official matters entrusted to me by Official Meng.

00:30:55.160 --> 00:30:56.860
I will leave you to enjoy your drinks.

00:30:58.160 --> 00:30:59.776
Only the Right Chancellor

00:30:59.800 --> 00:31:01.256
Could make you abandon A-Nian and me.

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:03.420
Sister Zhili, I will see you out.

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:05.216
And only Zhili

00:31:05.240 --> 00:31:06.136
Could make you abandon me.

00:31:06.160 --> 00:31:07.616
Your Majesty.

00:31:07.640 --> 00:31:08.536
Young Master Shen.

00:31:08.560 --> 00:31:09.536
I just remembered

00:31:09.560 --> 00:31:11.780
That Official Meng also assigned me some work.

00:31:11.960 --> 00:31:13.340
I will leave first.

00:31:17.320 --> 00:31:19.100
His Majesty's medicine is still the best.

00:31:21.160 --> 00:31:23.060
Why has everyone left?

00:31:37.400 --> 00:31:38.856
Mengmeng,

00:31:38.880 --> 00:31:41.496
Young Master He came personally to Bofeng House

00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:43.060
And specifically ordered lamb noodles.

00:31:43.880 --> 00:31:45.736
Could he think he punished you wrongly before

00:31:45.760 --> 00:31:46.896
And be looking for a chance

00:31:46.920 --> 00:31:48.456
To repair your relationship?

00:31:48.480 --> 00:31:50.140
The emperor's heart is difficult to fathom.

00:31:50.960 --> 00:31:52.536
We must not speculate recklessly,

00:31:52.560 --> 00:31:54.696
Much less flatter ourselves.

00:31:54.720 --> 00:31:57.136
True. He is the emperor, after all.

00:31:57.160 --> 00:31:59.096
You must never contradict him again,

00:31:59.120 --> 00:32:01.536
Or even several lives between us would not be enough to repay the offense.

00:32:01.560 --> 00:32:03.176
I did not contradict him.

00:32:03.200 --> 00:32:04.696
Of course not. You did not.

00:32:04.720 --> 00:32:05.696
Mengmeng, listen.

00:32:05.720 --> 00:32:06.616
In a moment, just say

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:08.460
You made this bowl of lamb noodles.

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:12.340
Fuzhi,

00:32:13.160 --> 00:32:14.940
That would be deceiving the emperor.

00:32:15.600 --> 00:32:17.220
Then what should we do?

00:32:22.440 --> 00:32:23.816
Yan Fuzhi...

00:32:23.840 --> 00:32:25.096
Listen to me.

00:32:25.120 --> 00:32:26.736
You sprinkled the scallions,

00:32:26.760 --> 00:32:28.456
Which means this bowl of lamb noodles

00:32:28.480 --> 00:32:29.376
Was made by you.

00:32:29.400 --> 00:32:31.176
I merely helped you a little.

00:32:31.200 --> 00:32:32.860
That is not deceiving the emperor.

00:32:44.680 --> 00:32:45.940
Mengmeng.

00:32:49.000 --> 00:32:50.220
Meng...

00:32:51.520 --> 00:32:53.380
Mengmeng, have you lost your mind?

00:32:59.600 --> 00:33:00.896
There.

00:33:00.920 --> 00:33:02.620
Now I made it.

00:33:30.960 --> 00:33:32.536
I still remember the bowl of lamb noodles

00:33:32.560 --> 00:33:33.940
That Cousin promised me last time.

00:33:34.520 --> 00:33:36.700
So you came today to collect a debt.

00:33:38.240 --> 00:33:39.136
Well?

00:33:39.160 --> 00:33:40.336
Are you satisfied

00:33:40.360 --> 00:33:41.856
With today's arrangements, Cousin?

00:33:41.880 --> 00:33:43.616
Is this not a little too extravagant?

00:33:43.640 --> 00:33:44.976
Do not worry, Cousin.

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:46.056
You will not have to spend anything today.

00:33:46.080 --> 00:33:47.820
Shopkeeper Yan is treating us.

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:50.576
So you charged everything to Miss Yan

00:33:50.600 --> 00:33:52.616
And are showing generosity at someone else's expense.

00:33:52.640 --> 00:33:54.376
Cousin, that is not fair.

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:55.296
I...

00:33:55.320 --> 00:33:57.060
Have prepared a great surprise for you.

00:33:57.520 --> 00:33:59.220
Proprietress Situ has arrived.

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:01.220
She's here.

00:34:03.080 --> 00:34:05.460
Young Master Shen. Young Master He.

00:34:06.560 --> 00:34:07.896
Thank you for inviting me.

00:34:07.920 --> 00:34:08.816
A pleasure to meet you.

00:34:08.840 --> 00:34:10.100
Proprietress Situ, the pleasure is mine.

00:34:10.560 --> 00:34:11.616
So this is

00:34:11.640 --> 00:34:13.500
The surprise Young Master Shen prepared.

00:34:17.840 --> 00:34:18.736
Young Master He,

00:34:18.760 --> 00:34:20.860
The lamb noodles Mengmeng made herself are here.

00:34:21.680 --> 00:34:22.820
Here...

00:34:28.320 --> 00:34:29.620
Please enjoy.

00:34:30.680 --> 00:34:31.900
Young Master He,

00:34:32.560 --> 00:34:34.216
-please enjoy. -Everyone is here now.

00:34:34.240 --> 00:34:35.776
Official Meng, Shopkeeper Yan,

00:34:35.800 --> 00:34:37.096
Allow me to make an introduction.

00:34:37.120 --> 00:34:38.216
This is the legendary...

00:34:38.240 --> 00:34:39.380
-Situ Xue. -Situ Xue.

00:34:39.920 --> 00:34:41.736
Official Meng, you know Proprietress Situ too?

00:34:41.760 --> 00:34:43.540
Young Master He has mentioned her before.

00:34:43.800 --> 00:34:44.696
I have long heard of your great reputation.

00:34:44.720 --> 00:34:45.896
You flatter me, Official Meng.

00:34:45.920 --> 00:34:47.296
I have long heard of your distinguished name.

00:34:47.320 --> 00:34:48.256
It is a great honor

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.656
To finally meet you today.

00:34:49.680 --> 00:34:50.576
Today,

00:34:50.600 --> 00:34:53.216
Cousin specially invited Proprietress Situ

00:34:53.240 --> 00:34:55.380
To add splendor to Bofeng House's opening.

00:34:56.040 --> 00:34:57.820
Thank you, Young Master He.

00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:02.256
And this...

00:35:02.280 --> 00:35:04.220
You must be Shopkeeper Yan of Bofeng House.

00:35:04.920 --> 00:35:06.816
Yes, that is me.

00:35:06.840 --> 00:35:08.776
I have instructed Sihua to arrange musicians

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:10.096
To perform for the celebration.

00:35:10.120 --> 00:35:12.376
-Congratulations on the opening of Bofeng House. -As this is our first meeting,

00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:14.696
I have prepared a modest gift, a golden qilin.

00:35:14.720 --> 00:35:16.816
May wealth flow endlessly to Shopkeeper Yan.

00:35:16.840 --> 00:35:17.896
Your presence at Bofeng House

00:35:17.920 --> 00:35:19.336
Already brings honor to this humble establishment.

00:35:19.360 --> 00:35:21.096
There was no need to bring a gift.

00:35:21.120 --> 00:35:23.340
Zhaocai, put it away carefully.

00:35:25.080 --> 00:35:26.496
Everyone, please stop standing.

00:35:26.520 --> 00:35:28.700
Come and try Bofeng House's signature dishes.

00:35:30.320 --> 00:35:32.216
I never expected the opening of Bofeng House in the capital

00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:34.136
-to draw the real Proprietress Situ. -Proprietress Situ, please try this.

00:35:34.160 --> 00:35:35.696
You rarely attend social gatherings,

00:35:35.720 --> 00:35:36.616
So today we owe Cousin

00:35:36.640 --> 00:35:38.260
For his generous hospitality...

00:35:40.640 --> 00:35:41.736
It is nothing.

00:35:41.760 --> 00:35:43.580
Everyone, eat and drink.

00:35:59.800 --> 00:36:01.696
Cousin normally cannot eat without something spicy.

00:36:01.720 --> 00:36:03.096
What is wrong today?

00:36:03.120 --> 00:36:04.016
Young Master He,

00:36:04.040 --> 00:36:05.856
A warm soup will settle your stomach.

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:07.940
Is the lamb soup good?

00:36:09.080 --> 00:36:10.260
It is.

00:36:10.920 --> 00:36:12.216
It is excellent.

00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:14.380
These lamb noodles taste just as they did in Shazhou:

00:36:14.560 --> 00:36:16.940
Spicy and fierce.

00:36:19.280 --> 00:36:20.860
Then have some more.

00:36:21.200 --> 00:36:22.416
In Shazhou, Young Master He

00:36:22.440 --> 00:36:24.216
Could eat two full bowls.

00:36:24.240 --> 00:36:25.456
Young Master He, drink some sea-buckthorn nectar.

00:36:25.480 --> 00:36:26.660
It is the best remedy for the heat.

00:36:29.320 --> 00:36:31.980
Miss Meng has treated me so warmly

00:36:32.800 --> 00:36:34.580
That I hardly know how to repay her.

00:36:35.840 --> 00:36:37.300
You are too polite, Young Master He.

00:36:37.640 --> 00:36:38.776
Compared with the thought you put into

00:36:38.800 --> 00:36:41.576
Inviting Proprietress Situ here,

00:36:41.600 --> 00:36:43.336
What is a single bowl of noodles?

00:36:43.360 --> 00:36:44.736
Proprietress Situ and I

00:36:44.760 --> 00:36:46.496
Have met only a few times.

00:36:46.520 --> 00:36:49.096
I was quite surprised

00:36:49.120 --> 00:36:50.780
That she honored us with her presence today.

00:36:52.200 --> 00:36:54.860
Shopkeeper Yan and I both do business on Changle Street,

00:36:55.200 --> 00:36:57.096
And I have long admired Official Meng's reputation.

00:36:57.120 --> 00:36:58.580
I have wanted to meet you for some time,

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:01.260
So naturally I accepted the invitation with pleasure.

00:37:02.400 --> 00:37:04.060
Let me take this opportunity

00:37:04.320 --> 00:37:05.780
To offer everyone a toast.

00:37:11.760 --> 00:37:13.736
I never expected the ruler of a nation

00:37:13.760 --> 00:37:15.140
To hold such a grudge,

00:37:15.360 --> 00:37:16.976
Deliberately bringing Situ Xue here to mock me

00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:19.340
For making a poor imitation of her in Shazhou.

00:37:19.600 --> 00:37:21.820
Now I cannot explain myself at all.

00:37:22.800 --> 00:37:23.936
You have truly ruined me.

00:37:23.960 --> 00:37:26.096
It seems their relationship

00:37:26.120 --> 00:37:28.340
Is not as simple as emperor and subject.

00:37:29.760 --> 00:37:31.576
I thought you could be reliable for once.

00:37:31.600 --> 00:37:33.260
You truly fail at everything you try.

00:37:33.680 --> 00:37:36.136
Fine wine, delicious food, and a beauty at my side.

00:37:36.160 --> 00:37:37.860
Today, we must drink to our hearts' content.

00:37:40.120 --> 00:37:42.096
It is rare for us all to gather like this,

00:37:42.120 --> 00:37:43.496
But I still have official duties.

00:37:43.520 --> 00:37:44.776
Please excuse me.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:46.536
Mengmeng, are you all right?

00:37:46.560 --> 00:37:48.780
-I'll go with you. -No need.

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:51.016
Proprietress Situ rarely visits.

00:37:51.040 --> 00:37:53.580
Stay and drink a few more cups with her.

00:37:57.280 --> 00:37:59.056
Keep eating and drinking.

00:37:59.080 --> 00:38:00.620
I also have important matters to handle.

00:38:01.040 --> 00:38:02.220
You continue without me.

00:38:04.680 --> 00:38:05.820
Cousin...

00:38:08.720 --> 00:38:10.696
Shopkeeper Yan, Young Master Shen,

00:38:10.720 --> 00:38:13.096
There are also urgent matters at my music house.

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:14.420
I will take my leave.

00:38:21.280 --> 00:38:23.016
Such fine Three-White Liquor,

00:38:23.040 --> 00:38:24.576
Yet everyone has left.

00:38:24.600 --> 00:38:26.740
Shopkeeper Yan, let us drink.

00:38:31.160 --> 00:38:32.340
Wait.

00:38:32.920 --> 00:38:33.976
It seems...

00:38:34.000 --> 00:38:35.816
The special reserve grape wine

00:38:35.840 --> 00:38:36.980
Has not been served yet.

00:38:38.240 --> 00:38:39.456
Young Master Shen,

00:38:39.480 --> 00:38:41.380
I will bring it to you at once.

00:38:42.120 --> 00:38:44.380
I hope you drink yourself to death.

00:38:45.960 --> 00:38:47.096
Young Master Shen,

00:38:47.120 --> 00:38:49.100
The special reserve grape wine is here.

00:38:50.160 --> 00:38:51.096
Have plenty.

00:38:51.120 --> 00:38:52.700
Just do not drink until you vomit.

00:38:53.520 --> 00:38:55.460
Cheers.

00:39:03.640 --> 00:39:04.780
Take care, honored guest.

00:39:11.200 --> 00:39:12.340
This way.

00:39:15.920 --> 00:39:17.336
Nine out of ten gangs gamble,

00:39:17.360 --> 00:39:18.980
And nine out of ten gambling games are rigged.

00:39:19.200 --> 00:39:22.100
I refuse to believe the Tiger Roar Gang is the exception.

00:39:26.960 --> 00:39:28.100
Stop.

00:39:29.280 --> 00:39:30.976
No unauthorized persons beyond this point.

00:39:31.000 --> 00:39:33.380
Why can no one go upstairs?

00:39:34.480 --> 00:39:35.860
Please forgive us, honored guest.

00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:38.660
These are the rules of Xingrong Gambling House.

00:39:39.600 --> 00:39:40.856
Only those who win ten thousand taels

00:39:40.880 --> 00:39:41.776
May enter the second floor.

00:39:41.800 --> 00:39:43.096
And you are?

00:39:43.120 --> 00:39:44.540
I am A-Gui, one of the dealers.

00:39:45.160 --> 00:39:46.056
You do not look familiar.

00:39:46.080 --> 00:39:48.696
Is this your first visit to our gambling house?

00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:49.736
We offer a gift to newcomers:

00:39:49.760 --> 00:39:51.336
Ten taels as a lucky stake.

00:39:51.360 --> 00:39:53.900
Your proprietor certainly knows how to do business.

00:39:54.480 --> 00:39:55.376
He must also be

00:39:55.400 --> 00:39:56.736
A famous figure in the martial world.

00:39:56.760 --> 00:39:57.896
You have a discerning eye, miss.

00:39:57.920 --> 00:39:59.016
Our proprietor's surname is Hao.

00:39:59.040 --> 00:40:00.536
The brothers on the road respectfully call him Uncle Hao.

00:40:00.560 --> 00:40:02.060
Uncle Hao?

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:03.656
Very well.

00:40:03.680 --> 00:40:05.580
Then I will test my luck today.

00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:07.140
Please.

00:40:12.080 --> 00:40:13.536
Miss, wait a moment.

00:40:13.560 --> 00:40:14.900
I will arrange a table for you.

00:40:17.040 --> 00:40:17.936
Third Master...

00:40:17.960 --> 00:40:18.856
A newcomer is joining a game.

00:40:18.880 --> 00:40:20.376
Would you care to take a seat?

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:22.056
Why would I gamble with a woman?

00:40:22.080 --> 00:40:23.580
Please...

00:40:24.880 --> 00:40:26.176
Uncle Wang,

00:40:26.200 --> 00:40:27.576
Come and join the table.

00:40:27.600 --> 00:40:28.816
A lady gambler?

00:40:28.840 --> 00:40:29.896
-No, no. -Please...

00:40:29.920 --> 00:40:31.500
I will gamble with you.

00:40:36.600 --> 00:40:38.860
Honored guest, please sit.

00:40:43.360 --> 00:40:45.576
Young Master He, you are in quite a mood today.

00:40:45.600 --> 00:40:47.780
I saw that no one would play against you,

00:40:48.720 --> 00:40:50.056
So I reluctantly decided

00:40:50.080 --> 00:40:51.500
To join you for one round.

00:40:52.680 --> 00:40:54.380
In that case,

00:40:55.960 --> 00:40:57.100
Let us begin.

